5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to verify if previous initiatives actually improved patient outcomes before committing more resources.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I’m less concerned with the idea’s merit than whether our current infrastructure can absorb it without seizing up.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Approval is easy; the real test is whether the supporting structure holds up in year two.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Rosters are where every new program eventually lands, and the teams it lands on are rarely the ones that asked for it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Before we choose, we must ask what this budget can truly build and what it will earn back, not just what it costs today.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Servas"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Servas**: Before we choose, we must ask what this budget can truly build and what it will earn back, not just what it costs today.""}]}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, your point about year two is critical. We must ensure the supporting structure is robust before we proceed.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, agreed. But infrastructure is the silent killer. If the rooms and booking screens can’t handle the load, the best idea still fails.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, precisely. The infrastructure fails because the people running it never agreed to the burden. I need to see where the last few starts actually collapsed.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, that’s exactly why I need the staffing records. If the burden lands on the wrong team, the whole thing collapses before it starts.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Yumi, the burden is real, but so is the silence of the ledger. We must know what this money can actually build before we ask who carries it.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, I agree. We must also verify if the previous attempts actually changed anything for patients before we add another to the pile.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, I hear you. But I need to know if the physical space and booking systems can even hold the weight before we discuss outcomes.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, the booking system is a black box. If it doesn't record the work, the work doesn't exist. I need to see what it actually holds.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, the booking system is important, but I need to see the staffing review. If the therapy and midwifery teams are stretched, the program fails before it starts.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, the ledger is equally opaque. I must see the allocation to know if we are building on solid ground or sinking sand.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, agreed. I will examine the readmission figures from the call-back trial to see if that earlier attempt actually changed patient outcomes.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, I will check the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage to see if the physical capacity can absorb another program.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, I’ll check the board minutes on the jointly run clinic to see exactly where that arrangement fell apart.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, I’ll check the therapy and midwifery staffing review to see where the pressure actually sits.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, I will examine the development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs to understand our true financial capacity.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
