37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,- **Benjamin**: The board minutes are damning. The joint clinic collapsed because neither department would hold the budget line.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: @Benjamin, that sounds like a recipe for disaster. I’m seeing similar cracks in the staffing review.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The ledger confirms my fears. The allocation is down a quarter, and fitting out space now eats into it. We are building on thin ice.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Servas"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Servas**: The ledger confirms my fears. The allocation is down a quarter, and fitting out space now eats into it. We are building on thin ice.""}]}"
