42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: @Servas, a quarter less? That explains why the joint clinic died. We can’t even afford to share the pain.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: @Benjamin, the staffing review is worse. Physios are leaving, but midwifery has unexpected slack. We must use that surplus wisely.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Yumi, that slack is a gift, but the ledger is a warning. We must spend that surplus where it truly counts, not where it is merely available.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Servas, the readmission data is clear. The trial worked, but only while funded. We cannot rely on temporary fixes.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,#### Turn 3 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: @Asuka, that’s the pattern. It works until the money stops. I need to know if the next one has a permanent home.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: @Benjamin, exactly. The midwifery slack is real, but it’s fragile. We need a program that uses that surplus without breaking the therapy team.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Yumi, the midwifery slack is a rare opportunity. We must anchor the new program there, where the capacity exists, rather than forcing it onto strained teams.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Servas, agreed. We must anchor the program in the midwifery slack, but only if the financial model is sustainable long-term.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"- **Toshio**: @Servas, the ledger is tight, but the physical space is the real bottleneck. I need to know if we can even fit this in.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, the joint clinic failed because the structure was hollow. If the space is there, we must ensure the people actually own it.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: @Toshio, if the space is tight, we must ensure the midwifery team isn't stretched thin. I need to see how the rosters actually look.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Toshio, the space is a constraint, but the money is the limit. We must fit the program within what the ledger allows, not what the building wishes.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
